                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Forbidden Island is a cooperative commercial board and card game where players race to recover treasures and escape before a sinking island disappears.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Designed by Matt Leacock and published by Gamewright Games in 2010, Forbidden Island uses decks of cards to drive flooding, treasure collection, and the rising danger level.',
              },
